INTERSOLV Corporate Profile

INTERSOLV is the leader in applications enablement software for the 
client/server, Internet and Intranet worlds.  Organizations 
worldwide rely on INTERSOLV products and services to gain 
competitive advantage by accelerating the development, delivery and 
deployment of their software applications.  INTERSOLV offers 
comprehensive cross-platform solutions for object-oriented 
development, software configuration management, enterprise 
client/server development, middleware and data connectivity.   
INTERSOLV, with annual revenues exceeding $145 million, has more 
than 1.5 million customers at 20,000+ sites around the world.  The 
